@NovaKnowledge.Chat.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### Create a chat session
POST {{NovaKnowledge.Chat.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenantId": "contoso" }

### Send a message (Server-Sent Events stream)
POST {{NovaKnowledge.Chat.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "What is the PTO policy?" }

### Get message history
GET {{NovaKnowledge.Chat.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Accept: application/json

### Get agent trace for a session
GET {{NovaKnowledge.Chat.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/trace
Accept: application/json

###
